&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Program Manager to empower our product teams to conduct effective self-service research. In this role, you&#39;ll create and maintain the infrastructure that democratizes user research across Discord, enabling designers, product managers, and engineers to gather valuable user insights independently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with Design, PM, Engineering, and other XFN partners, you’ll serve as the bridge between our product teams and research tools, developing training materials, best practices, and support systems that make user research accessible to all. This is an opportunity to build a foundational program that will scale as Discord grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design self-serve research systems and processes for PMs and Designers that can scale efficiently as Discord grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage partnerships with external UXR platforms (like &lt;a href=&quot;http://UserTesting.com&quot;&gt;UserTesting.com&lt;/a&gt;), serving as the primary point of contact and administrator&lt;/li&gt;
