&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience as an Engineering Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience managing large databases at scale and in complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked with high scale distributed systems used by tens or hundreds of millions of users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with a variety of teams across multiple functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel in undefined environments and get excited about finding pragmatic solutions to complex technical or organizational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for coaching and developing engineers, but also love to dig into technical problems when the opportunity arises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You keep up with the industry trends and continue to grow your technical knowledge and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
